BT 1 0 0 1 0 102.45 Tm /F1 9.15 Tf 12.4 TL (The employee agrees that all issues or disputes \("issues"\) pertaining to his or her employment with Marsala's Pizza Inc.) Tj T* (DBA Zazzo's Pizzeria, and Westmont Marsala's Pizza Inc DBA Zazzo's, will in all instances initially be submitted in writing) Tj T* (to Dominc Barraco, personnel, manager, or his representative for informal attempts to resolve the issue. Such written) Tj T* (submission shall identify the nature of the issue, the specifics of the issue such as the date\(s\) and time\(s\) it occurred, the) Tj T* (person\(s\) involved, a description of what occurred, and such other details as would enable Marsala's Pizza Inc. DBA) Tj T* (Zazzo's Pizzeria, and Westmont Marsala's Pizza Inc DBA Zazzo's Pizzeria to conduct an inquiry into the issue that would) Tj T* (be reasonably likely to obtain an understanding of all relevant facts. The employee's written statement of the issue should) Tj T* (also include a description of any request, proposal, or suggestion that the employee may have for resolving the issue,) Tj T* (including any proposal or suggestion for avoiding a recurrence of the issue.) Tj T* ET
