BT 1 0 0 1 0 152.05 Tm /F1 9.15 Tf 12.4 TL (Marsala's Pizza Inc. DBA Zazzo's Pizzeria, and Westmont Marsala's Pizza Inc DBA Zazzo's Pizzeria shall have up to) Tj T* (thirty \(30\) days in which to conduct an investigation and meet with the employee to informally seek to resolve the issue.) Tj T* (Should the issue not be resolved within an additional two week period of Marsala's Pizza Inc. DBA Zazzo's Pizzeria, and) Tj T* (Westmont Marsala's Pizza Inc DBA Zazzo's Pizzeria response to the issue \(or within such additional time as the parties) Tj T* (may agree to extend the time to reach resolution\) the parties agree to submit the issue/dispute to binding arbitration to be) Tj T* (conducted in Chicago, Illinois in accordance with the expedited arbitration rules then in existence under the provisions of) Tj T* (the American Arbitration Association rules and procedures governing employment disputes, as governed by application of) Tj T* (the laws of the State of Illinois, and such Federal laws as are implicated, as interpreted by the federal courts of the) Tj T* -0.065198 Tw (Northern District of Illinois in the event of conflict between the federal courts. The decision of the arbitrator shall be binding) Tj T* 0 Tw (and enforceable by resort to the courts, if necessary, and shall be in lieu of, and not in existence or in future enacted law) Tj T* (that purports to govern the employer/employee relationship. The arbitrator's authority shall include the authority to award) Tj T* (costs and fees to the prevailing party, and such personal remedies as may be available to the employee had the) Tj T* (employee resorted to traditional avenues of seeking redress.) Tj T* ET
